      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "取消等普通操作使用细边内容面。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-secondary\">取消</button>",
      "css": ".ds-secondary{font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.6;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;min-height:36px;padding:7px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line, #dce5dd);border-radius:var(--radius-control, 8px);color:var(--subtle, #435c4f);background:var(--surface, #ffffff);transition:background-color 150ms var(--ease, cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)),color 150ms var(--ease, cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)),border-color 150ms var(--ease, cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1));cursor:pointer;}.ds-secondary:hover{color:var(--ink, #243a31);background:var(--surface-2, #eef3ed);}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus, #377b5c);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-secondary:active{filter:brightness(.96);}.ds-secondary:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.55;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-secondary{transition:none;animation:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "目录搜索",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "search",
      "description": "整行搜索；容器表达聚焦，手机隐藏快捷键提示。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"/><path d=\"m16 16 5 5\"/></svg><input aria-label=\"搜索入口\" placeholder=\"搜索入口名称、地址或关联密钥…\"><kbd>Ctrl / ⌘ K</kbd></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;width:100%;min-height:48px;padding:0 14px;border:1px solid var(--line, #dce5dd);border-radius:9px;color:var(--muted, #607369);background:var(--surface, #ffffff);}.ds-search:focus-within{border-color:var(--focus, #377b5c);outline:2px solid var(--accent-soft, #e7f1e8);}.ds-search input{width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:46px;padding:11px 0;border:0;outline:none;color:var(--ink, #243a31);background:transparent;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;caret-color:var(--accent, #2c6b50);}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--muted, #607369);opacity:1;}.ds-search kbd{flex:none;padding:2px 5px;border:1px solid var(--line, #dce5dd);border-radius:4px;color:var(--muted, #607369);background:var(--canvas, #f5f7f4);font-family:inherit;font-size:10px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-search input{font-size:14px;}.ds-search kbd{display:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "深绿导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-default",
      "description": "当前导航、计数与普通项目；真实抽屉复用相同导航。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"我的资料\"><button class=\"ds-nav-active\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/></svg><span>全部入口</span><small>6</small></button><button><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"9\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"m11 12 9 9m-4-4 3-3m-6 0 3-3\"/></svg><span>密钥</span><small>3</small></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:grid;gap:5px;padding:16px;color:var(--rail-ink, #eef5ef);background:var(--rail, #173f35);}.ds-nav button{font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.6;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;min-height:36px;padding:7px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line, #dce5dd);border-radius:var(--radius-control, 8px);color:var(--subtle, #435c4f);background:var(--surface, #ffffff);transition:background-color 150ms var(--ease, cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)),color 150ms var(--ease, cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)),border-color 150ms var(--ease, cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1));cursor:pointer;justify-content:start;gap:11px;min-height:43px;width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border:0;color:var(--rail-muted, #b3cabe);background:transparent;text-align:left;font-weight:400;}.ds-nav button:hover{color:var(--rail-ink, #eef5ef);background:#244d3f;}.ds-nav .ds-nav-active{color:var(--rail-ink, #eef5ef);background:var(--rail-active, #31594b);font-weight:600;}.ds-nav small{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-nav button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #c1e9c8;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-nav button:active{filter:brightness(.96);}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-nav button{min-height:46px;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav button{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "资源分类标记",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "category-postgresql",
      "description": "彩色图标底板与类型文字组合；颜色不单独传达类型。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-category\"><span class=\"ds-category-icon\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"8\" ry=\"3\"/><path d=\"M4 5v14c0 4 16 4 16 0V5M4 12c0 4 16 4 16 0\"/></svg></span><span>PostgreSQL</span></span>",
      "css": ".ds-category{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--muted, #607369);font-family:inherit;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;}.ds-category-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:39px;height:39px;flex:none;border-radius:10px;color:var(--violet, #755493);background:var(--violet-soft, #f1ebf7);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "入口资料卡",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "entry-card",
      "description": "名称、地址、密钥与动作分区；示例为虚构入口。",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-top\"><span class=\"ds-card-kind\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"4\" ry=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/></svg></span><span>网站</span></div><div class=\"ds-card-body\"><h2><a href=\"https://example.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">文档入口 <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3h7v7m0-7L10 14M10 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5\"/></svg></a></h2><p>docs.example.org</p></div><div class=\"ds-card-keys\"><div class=\"ds-card-heading\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"9\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"m11 12 9 9m-4-4 3-3m-6 0 3-3\"/></svg><select aria-label=\"文档入口的复制密钥\" disabled><option>示例密钥 · example</option></select></div><button><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 8V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3\"/></svg>复制密钥</button></div><footer><a href=\"https://example.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">打开网站 <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3h7v7m0-7L10 14M10 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5\"/></svg></a></footer></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line, #dce5dd);border-radius:var(--radius-card, 12px);background:var(--surface, #ffffff);font-family:inherit;line-height:1.6;transition:border-color 150ms var(--ease, cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1));}.ds-card:hover,.ds-card:focus-within{border-color:var(--accent, #2c6b50);}.ds-card-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:20px 19px 0;color:var(--muted, #607369);font-size:11px;}.ds-card-kind{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:39px;height:39px;flex:none;border-radius:10px;color:var(--blue, #426b9b);background:var(--blue-soft, #eaf0f8);}.ds-card-body{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:15px 19px 17px;}.ds-card h2{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;}.ds-card h2 a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--ink, #243a31);text-decoration:none;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-card h2 a:hover,.ds-card footer a:hover{color:var(--accent, #2c6b50);}.ds-card p{overflow:hidden;margin:0;color:var(--muted, #607369);font-family:ui-monospace,\"SFMono-Regular\",Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}.ds-card-keys{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:start;justify-content:center;gap:7px;min-height:82px;margin:0 19px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line, #dce5dd);color:var(--subtle, #435c4f);font-size:11px;}.ds-card-keys button{font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.6;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;min-height:36px;padding:7px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line, #dce5dd);border-radius:var(--radius-control, 8px);color:var(--subtle, #435c4f);background:var(--surface, #ffffff);transition:background-color 150ms var(--ease, cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)),color 150ms var(--ease, cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)),border-color 150ms var(--ease, cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1));cursor:pointer;min-height:30px;padding:4px 8px;border:0;color:var(--accent, #2c6b50);background:var(--accent-soft, #e7f1e8);font-size:10px;}.ds-card-keys button:hover{color:var(--on-accent, #ffffff);background:var(--accent, #2c6b50);}.ds-card footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;min-height:43px;padding:5px 13px 5px 19px;border-top:1px solid var(--line, #dce5dd);border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;background:var(--canvas, #f5f7f4);}.ds-card footer a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:31px;padding:3px 0;color:var(--subtle, #435c4f);font-size:11px;text-decoration:none;}.ds-card a:focus-visible,.ds-card button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus, #377b5c);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-card button:active{filter:brightness(.96);}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-card-keys button{min-height:38px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:11px;}.ds-card footer a{min-height:38px;font-size:12px;}}@media(max-width:480px){.ds-card-body{padding-top:13px;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-card,.ds-card button{transition:none;}} .ds-card-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;min-width:0;width:100%;color:var(--accent, #2c6b50);}.ds-card-heading select{flex:1;min-width:0;width:100%;min-height:25px;padding:2px 3px;border:0;border-radius:4px;color:var(--subtle, #435c4f);background:transparent;font-family:inherit;font-size:11px;text-overflow:ellipsis;opacity:1;appearance:none;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--subtle, #435c4f);}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-card-heading select{min-height:34px;font-size:12px;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "大学图书馆分类导视的私人资料目录",
    "overview": "以森林绿导航、雾绿画布和白色工作区建立稳定的查找环境。入口名称是阅读主角，分类颜色帮助识别资源，关联密钥在卡片内形成独立的操作区。标准网页控件承担搜索、筛选和编辑；图书馆导视是颜色与秩序的来源。\n\n密度服务于反复查找：标题、地址、关联关系和动作按固定顺序排列。系统无衬线覆盖中文与拉丁文，等宽体只用于地址及只读配置。浅色是默认主题，手动深色主题沿用同一组语义变量。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "稳定的深绿导航与清晰内容层级。",
      "分类图标始终伴随类型文字。",
      "入口资料与关联密钥在卡片内分区。",
      "浅深主题共享组件与可见键盘焦点。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Theme Rule",
        "body": "组件使用语义变量；深色模式替换变量值，导航亮字与状态文字继续保留可读性。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Name First Rule",
        "body": "资料名称高于地址与关联元数据；地址使用等宽体，主要操作保留文字。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Overlay Depth Rule",
        "body": "目录卡片保持平面，菜单与对话框使用阴影表达浮层关系。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 使用语义颜色变量，使同一组件自动适应浅色与深色主题。",
      "Do 将网站、PostgreSQL、Redis、通用服务的类型色与图标、文字一起呈现。",
      "Do 把查看资料、打开网站、复制账号和复制密钥做成各自明确的操作。",
      "Do 保留焦点轮廓、原生表单标签、筛选按下状态与减少动态效果支持。",
      "Do 在窄屏允许筛选换行，将导航移入抽屉，并提高卡片内操作高度。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 把目录卡片整体变成会吞掉复制和菜单动作的点击区域。",
      "Don't 用颜色单独表示资源类型、选中状态或未关联状态。",
      "Don't 将服务入口描述为可以连接或测试的客户端；它们的动作是查看资料。",
      "Don't 为地址和配置之外的普通中文正文引入等宽字体。"
    ]
  }
}
